# Unreal Engine generated / cache directories
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
# Build/ holds engine-default Info.Template.plist, entitlements and (on Windows)
# the app icon. All regenerated today, so ignoring is safe. Once an icon or
# plist is customized for a release build, un-ignore those paths:
#   !Build/Mac/Resources/
#   !Build/Windows/Resources/
Build/

